  "bodyHash": "44f05b5f2282add4",
  "content": "\n\n<p>Tinkers' Advanced-Materials 是《Tinkers' Construct》的附加模組，新增了眾多強大的素材（主要與其他科技模組進行整合）。</p>\n<p>需要 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tinkers-advanced-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tinkers' Advanced-Core</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_0f33d468-d60d-40a7-ba17-5acf19354c0d.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_d211f8d6-f992-4670-bf33-44dd00a64cbf.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">大多數素材皆具備專屬的修正器。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">整合功能可在 tinkers_advanced_core-common 設定檔中切換，修正器的行為則可在 tinkers_advanced_materials-common 設定檔中微調。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
